/T (Based on the data by location, the trends vary across regions. Denpasar shows positive performance with increases in CTR and Purchases. In Jakarta, clicks and page views are rising, but Purchases are declining, indicating possible issues during checkout or pricing. Balikpapan and Bandung show high interest, yet Purchases remain stagnant. Makassar and Medan see an increase in clicks but a decrease in page views. Palembang and Semarang experience rising Purchases despite lower CTR, while Surabaya and Yogyakarta show a downward trend in Purchases.)
/E (Based on the data by location, the trends vary across regions. Denpasar shows positive performance with increases in CTR and Purchases. In Jakarta, clicks and page views are rising, but Purchases are declining, indicating possible issues during checkout or pricing. Balikpapan and Bandung show high interest, yet Purchases remain stagnant. Makassar and Medan see an increase in clicks but a decrease in page views. Palembang and Semarang experience rising Purchases despite lower CTR, while Surabaya and Yogyakarta show a downward trend in Purchases.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [20]
